Subject: [PATCH] Add optical FOD support

Restore mask acquisition/cleanup and window flags on the current SDK-37
authentication, one-hand, session, hidden-keyguard and unlock paths.
R8 merged the former interface defaults into KeyguardUpdateMonitor;
use its current virtual dispatch, not a removed interface. Keep modern
callbacks, face/NowBar policy and the existing fast-unlock helper ABI.
Derive optical support from the target floating feature.

